an splurge on those hurricanes oweee!"},{"business_id":"W0xL1fk3WJqtt90mgP-7WA","review_id":"SxK4CDRFkQ-FVqqf2tHAOg","date":"2012-11-16T00:38:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8853649497032166,"text_excerpt":"This CVS is conveniently located inside the French Quarters. Here you can pick up everything you need...that might includes some alcoholic drinks... The amazing thing is their beer selections are just amazing much better than water... The shelves are well stocked for everyday needs.. Closes early at 10 pm though."},{"business_id":"W0xL1fk3WJqtt90mgP-7WA","review_id":"27rVuYf7wtTkWFxmc3GZCg","date":"2019-08-16T18:13:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8650341033935547,"text_excerpt":"I dove in here in search of a bottle of wine and they did not disappoint. Since I'm going on a Carnival Cruise tomorrow, I can take 1 bottle of wine or champagne and I had to buy it. So in I stopped and I felt like I was in a small liquor store instead of a CVS Pharmacy. They had a great selection including a couple of my faves! Score!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"W0xL1fk3WJqtt90mgP-7WA","photo_id":"4g6avsybl33gmUE2Gub2Bg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4g6avsybl33gmUE2Gub2Bg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
